{"ref":"BDB, סוֹף","hw":"סוֹף","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">סוֹף</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.2\">Ec 7:2</a></sup> <strong>end</strong>, late synon. of <span dir=\"rtl\">קֵץ</span>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ס׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.11\">Ec 3:11</a>, cstr. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.16\">2 Ch 20:16</a> + 2 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">סֹפוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:26\" href=\"/Joel.2.26\">Jo 2:26</a>;—<em>end</em> of wady <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.16\">2 Ch 20:16</a>, of invading swarm <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:20\" href=\"/Joel.2.20\">Jo 2:20</a>; of God’s work <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵרֹאשׁ וְעַד־סוֹף</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.11\">Ec 3:11</a>; death as <em>end</em> of all men <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.2\">7:2</a>; = <em>conclusion, sum</em> of instruction <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 12:13\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.12.13\">12:13</a>. Cf. Biblical Aramaic.","next":"BDB, סוּפָה","prev":"BDB, סוּף"}